SELECT DISTINCT ?item ?itemLabel ?latitude ?longitude ?area ?areaUnit ?areaUnitLabel ?length ?lengthUnit ?lengthUnitLabel ?width ?widthUnit ?widthUnitLabel ?perimeter ?perimeterUnit ?perimeterUnitLabel ?elevation ?elevationUnit ?elevationUnitLabel ?partOf ?partOfLabel ?locatedIn ?locatedInLabel WHERE {
